 145:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****   /* This variable is updated in three ways:
ARM GAS  C:\Users\31414\AppData\Local\Temp\ccCHeg6c.s 			page 4


 146:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****       1) by calling CMSIS function SystemCoreClockUpdate()
 147:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****       2) by calling HAL API function HAL_RCC_GetHCLKFreq()
 148:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****       3) each time HAL_RCC_ClockConfig() is called to configure the system clock frequency
 149:../../Common/Src/system_stm32h7xx_dualcore_boot_cm4_cm7.c ****          Note: If you use this function to configure the system clock; then there
